WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.176
Open the staff editing workspace. Expand the workspace, then select the existing employee instead of creating a duplicate profile.

00:00:21.176 --> 00:00:31.624
Check the employee details. Review the employee’s name, work contact, title and school. Login access is a separate responsibility.

00:00:31.624 --> 00:00:42.441
Review classroom and background status. Use approved staffing and credential information. Do not change roles or kiosk credentials just to complete training.

00:00:42.441 --> 00:00:54.214
Review before saving. If an authorized profile correction is needed, save once and verify the employee record and classroom roster. This example only reviews the profile.

